                <pb facs="1100" n="1020" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg1020"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Leishman to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Constantinople</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1902-02-03"><hi rendition="#italic">February 3,
                        1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Leishman reports that negotiations have been renewed, and the committee
                    reports progress, but that everything is being done to keep this secret for the
                    present. Mr. Leishman is quite hopeful of an early and satisfactory
                    conclusion.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
